{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01XiqWhUfhSuPx8UEa4MzFS6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V74ggRQJm8mjGeYkWqD8rT","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/philip/projects/hw-budget-tests/plan-gen-execution/agentRoot/plan/merged/plan.md","old_string":"Add the `\"workspaces\"` field to `source/hankweave/package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"@southbridgeai/hankweave\",\n  \"version\": \"0.5.6\",\n  \"workspaces\": [\"docs\"],\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nThe root package is itself an implicit workspace member in Bun workspaces, so the runtime's own dependencies, scripts, and `\"files\"` field continue to work unchanged.","new_string":"Add the `\"workspaces\"` field to `source/hankweave/package.json`. Place it after `\"engines\"` and before `\"scripts\"`, adjacent to other structural metadata fields. The current field order is: `name`, `version`, `description`, `author`, `keywords`, `homepage`, `type`, `publishConfig`, `bin`, `main`, `files`, `engines`, `scripts`, `devDependencies`, `peerDependencies`, `dependencies`. The result:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"@southbridgeai/hankweave\",\n  \"version\": \"0.5.6\",\n  ...\n  \"engines\": { \"node\": \">=20.0.0\" },\n  \"workspaces\": [\"docs\"],\n  \"scripts\": { ... },\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nThe root package is itself an implicit workspace member in Bun workspaces, so the runtime's own dependencies, scripts, and `\"files\"` field continue to work unchanged."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":417,"cache_read_input_tokens":98259,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":417},"output_tokens":491,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"776a0f8a-96ed-40de-9838-b3734a846e63","uuid":"de68d166-cb62-4d1b-9fa7-9bc15c3e8e2e","times