generate-schemas` runs).\n\n12. **Edge cases**: Added items 7 (tsconfig scope) and 8 (Biome scope) to the edge cases list.\n\n13. **Tables**: Updated code references table, summary of changes table, and commit message.\n\n**Thoughts file**: Written to `plan/review/current/updation_thoughts_and_changes.md` with detailed reasoning for each change, including the one area where I deviated from the review's suggestion (Vercel shallow clone — kept simple command, added caveat about safe failure mode)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":234,"cache_read_input_tokens":126162,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":234},"output_tokens":654,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"776a0f8a-96ed-40de-9838-b3734a846e63","uuid":"17835f94-edf9-4a7a-abfe-12572bba41ec","timestamp":"2026-03-05T12:48:52.657Z"}
